/*
 * Hartwick Atelier — PRODUCT PAGE (liminal)
 *
 * Built to `04_HA_Product_Desktop_REVISED_EDITABLE.pdf` (Aloha's revised
 * desktop wireframe), 3 September 2026.
 *
 * The opening section is the three-column hero — sticky left rail, scrolling
 * media rail, sticky buy rail — rendered by the custom `ha-product` section.
 * See sections/ha-product.liquid for why that one section is custom while the
 * form inside it is still Luxe's own snippets.
 *
 * Below it, the sections follow the wireframe's ORDER and STRUCTURE. Aloha
 * asked that only the structure and positions be taken from that file, not its
 * colours, so the decorative bands are dropped: every section sits on the brand
 * page ground, with the Masters and Register on the established dark field.
 *
 * Field colours are section settings (`field`), so the alternation can be
 * retuned from the theme editor. All placeholder copy is marked on screen and
 * switches to real data the moment the hartwick.* content exists.
 *
 * ------------------------------------------------------------
 * NOTE: this file is also written by the Shopify theme editor.
 * ------------------------------------------------------------
 */
